<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Agresso.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Agresso.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Agresso, a producer of client/server business applications software, was rated &quot;market performer&quot; as Goldman Sachs started coverage of the stock, Goldman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
